      "id": "5fc1aef337830f001e05c27e",
      "text": "試行錯誤",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1606528757,
      "updated": 1606528757
    },
    {
      "id": "6b023fcf00000000001f5b96",
      "text": ">種々の方法を繰り返し試みて失敗を重ねながら解決方法を追求すること。「試行錯誤を重ねる」",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1795309520,
      "updated": 1795309528
    },
    {
      "id": "6b023fd100000000001f5b97",
      "text": "[https://kotobank.jp/word/%E8%A9%A6%E8%A1%8C%E9%8C%AF%E8%AA%A4-73012 試行錯誤(シコウサクゴ)とは？ 意味や使い方 - コトバンク]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1795309522,
      "updated": 1795309550
    },
    {
      "id": "6b02402900000000001f5b99",
      "text": "trial and error",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1795309609,
      "updated": 1795309611
    },
    {
      "id": "6b02402b00000000001f5b9a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1795309612,
      "updated": 1795309612
    },
    {
      "id": "6b0240a400000000001f5b9f",
      "text": "出典",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1795309732,
      "updated": 1795309740
    },
    {
      "id": "6b02402f00000000001f5b9b",
      "text": " 英語 trial and errorの訳語。心理学の用語から",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1795309616,
      "updated": 1795309743
    },
    {
      "id": "6b02408600000000001f5b9c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1795309702,
      "updated": 1795309702
    },
    {
      "id": "5fc1aef51280f0000065462d",
      "text": "大事",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1606528757,
      "updated": 1606528761
    },
    {
      "id": "5fc1aef91280f0000065462f",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1606528761,
      "updated": 1606528761
    },
    {
      "id": "5fc1aef91280f00000654630",
      "text": "一方である程度は省けるような環境にすべき",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1606528761,
      "updated": 1606528784
    },
    {
      "id": "5fc1af0f1280f00000654632",
      "text": "　先人がやってくれた試行錯誤を無視して1から試行錯誤していたのでは先に進めない",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1606528784,
      "updated": 1606528905
    },
    {
      "id": "5fc1af891280f00000654635",
      "text": "　\t[車輪の再発明]とも",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1606528905,
      "updated": 1606528914
    },
    {
      "id": "5fc1af3c1280f00000654634",
      "text": "　既に試行錯誤されたことはさっさと学んでその先のstageに進むべき",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1606528828,
      "updated": 1606528979
    },
    {
      "id": "5fc1afd31280f00000654636",
      "text": "　\tそのまだ誰もやったことのない領域で試行錯誤する",
      "userId": "5ef2bdebb60650001e1280f0",
      "created": 1606528979,
      "updated": 1606529002
    },
    {
